 calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2026 so far, the county&rsquo;s middle value sat at 63% of normal for March to April and 59% of normal for April to May. Grid 33423 had its driest year in 1988 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
